# generated / machine-specific — rebuild, not committed
#
# `data/` holds a database extracted from the locally installed (licensed) VSL libraries.
# It is regenerable and machine-specific, so it is not published here. Rebuild with:
#   powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/build-vsl-patch-db.ps1 -LibraryRoot "D:\VSL Library"
data/*
!data/README.md

# personal habits / preferences — local only
references/user-habits.md

# local outputs
generated/
*.tmp
*.tmp.json
*.log
